:: You [markdown]

## Character Creation

Your name? <<textbox "(Your First Name)" "$p.name">> <<textbox "$p.surname" "(Your Surname)">>
Pronouns? <<dropdown $p.pn>>
<<options $p.pronouns[]>>
<</dropdown>>

When people describe you, what words do they use to do so? You may choose any combination.

<label><<checkbox "$p.ptraits.kind" autocheck>> Kind</label>
<label><<checkbox "$p.ptraits.cynical" autocheck>> Cynical</label>

<label><<checkbox "$p.ptraits.innocent" autocheck>> Innocent</label>
<label><<checkbox "$p.ptraits.experienced" autocheck>> Experienced</label>
The above can change throughout your playthrough, this is just for the start. Over 25 different sensual scenes triggers Experienced "on" and Innocent "off"

<label><<checkbox "$p.ptraits.prude">> Prude</label>
<label><<checkbox "$p.ptraits.open">> Open-minded</label>

<label><<checkbox "$p.ptraits.mute" autocheck>> Mute</label> ** Warning: This will remove your ability to speak!**
<label><<checkbox "$p.ptraits.kind" autocheck>> Selectively Mute</label> **Warning: This will remove your ability to speak from Sex and Battle Scenes!**

<label><<checkbox "$p.ptraits.confident" autocheck>> Confident</label>
<label><<checkbox "$p.ptraits.meek" autocheck>> Meek</label>

<label><<checkbox "$p.ptraits.dramatic" autocheck>> Dramatic</label>
<label><<checkbox "$p.ptraits.literal" autocheck>> Takes Things Literally</label>
<label><<checkbox "$p.ptraits.humorous" autocheck>> Has a Sense of Humor</label>
<label><<checkbox "$p.ptraits.autistic" autocheck>> Mentally Disabled/Autistic</label>

<label><<checkbox "$p.ptraits.introvert" true autocheck>> Introverted</label>
<label><<checkbox "$p.ptraits.extrovert" true autocheck>> Extroverted</label>
<label><<checkbox "$p.ptraits.ambivert" true autocheck>> Ambiverted</label>

### Your Gender

What do you describe yourself as?

<<dropdown "$p.gender">>
<<options $p.phystraits.gender[]>>
<</dropdown>>

Are you heavily muscled? 
<<cycle "$p.muscles">>
<<option "Yes." true>>
<<option "No." false>>
<</cycle>>

